<title>POLAND: Polish August unemployment rate falls to 13.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Polish August unemployment rate falls to 13.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland</p>
<p>fell to 13.8 percent in August from 14.1 percent in July and</p>
<p>15.2 percent in August 1995, figures from the Central</p>
<p>Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p> POLISH UNEMPLOYMENT	     AUGUST	JULY	 AUGUST 1995</p>
<p> number of jobless million	2.401	2.466	   2.690</p>
<p> pct of workforce		    13.8	 14.1	    15.2</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
